('656cd034-e6d2-5611-bd70-5862c34d4c67', '5175de27-0a67-58f0-a8f2-53315f5a6c81', 'D078', 'D078:psychology-social-behaviour', '2c13d0e5-7dd0-53d3-8e5d-dc0f000c6a9e', 'D078|thanatology researcher', 'conditional', false, 'The occupation can fit the area only under the recorded scope condition; the generic role record does not justify student promotion.', 'Thanatology researchers study death and the dying in a variety of scientific fields such as psychology, sociology, physiology and anthropology. They contribute to the growth of knowledge on aspects of death such as the psychological phenomena the dying and those around them are experiencing.', 'psychological, sociological, anthropological or demographic research on death/dying; physiological or clinical research alone is outside this route.', 'psychological, sociological, anthropological or demographic research on death/dying; physiological or clinical research alone is outside this route.', '[{"url":"https://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/9851c83c-5670-4da0-964a-1ef0e682e30b"},{"url":"http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/9851c83c-5670-4da0-964a-1ef0e682e30b"},{"url":"https://uis.unesco.org/node/3080050"},{"url":"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/in/documentViewer.xhtml?+v=2.1.196&ark=%2Fark%3A%2F48223%2Fpf0000235049%2FPDF%2F235049eng.pdf&file=%2Fin%2Frest%2FannotationSVC%2FDownloadWatermarkedAttachment%2Fattach_import_63478a00-96f0-4fee-aea7-1533d340d96f%3F_%3D235049eng.pdf&id=p%3A%3Ausmarcdef_0000235049&locale=en&multi=true"},{"url":"https://www.unesco.org/uk/query-list/s/419467"},{"url":"https://www.un.org/development/desa/pd/"}]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/9851c83c-5670-4da0-964a-1ef0e682e30b","locator":"Role task/work-activity evidence used in the D078 parent-domain review; exact occupation page or source record.","jurisdiction":"global/international","access_date":"2026-10-08","review_date":"2026-10-08","supports":"Role task and work-activity evidence; not title-only inference."},{"url":"