('2c0a3aa7-71d7-5071-b624-509cf497d20e', '5175de27-0a67-58f0-a8f2-53315f5a6c81', 'D078', 'D078:human-geography-population', 'fc1c183f-0d42-536a-a0a2-8fbb64f9f41a', 'D078|geographer', 'conditional', false, 'The occupation can fit the area only under the recorded scope condition; the generic role record does not justify student promotion.', 'Geographers are scholars who study human and physical geography. Depending on their specialisation, they study political, economical and cultural aspects of humanity contained within human geography. Moreover, they study land formations, soils, natural frontiers, and water flows contained in physica', 'human, cultural, political or social/economic geography; physical-geography-only work is outside D078.', 'human, cultural, political or social/economic geography; physical-geography-only work is outside D078.', '[{"url":"http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/bac64fa2-dcd6-47bb-8e5c-04e04a86a199"},{"url":"https://www.onetonline.org/link/summary/19-2099.01"},{"url":"https://www.onetonline.org/link/summary/19-3092.00"},{"url":"https://www.onetonline.org/link/summary/25-1064.00"},{"url":"https://uis.unesco.org/node/3080050"},{"url":"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/in/documentViewer.xhtml?+v=2.1.196&ark=%2Fark%3A%2F48223%2Fpf0000235049%2FPDF%2F235049eng.pdf&file=%2Fin%2Frest%2FannotationSVC%2FDownloadWatermarkedAttachment%2Fattach_import_63478a00-96f0-4fee-aea7-1533d340d96f%3F_%3D235049eng.pdf&id=p%3A%3Ausmarcdef_0000235049&locale=en&multi=true"},{"url":"https://www.unesco.org/uk/query-list/s/419467"},{"url":"https://www.un.org/development/desa/pd/"},{"url":"https://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/bac64fa2-dcd6-47bb-8e5c-04e04a86a199"},{"url":"https://www.onetcenter.org/database.html"}]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/bac64fa2-dcd6-47bb-8e5c-04e04a86a199","locator":"Role task/work-activity evidence used in the D078 parent-domain review; exact occupation page or source record.","jurisdiction":"global/international","acc